---
import '../styles/tokens.css';
import '../styles/evidence-graph.css';

const githubUrl = 'https://github.com/lofibrainwav/HyoDo';
const pypiUrl = 'https://pypi.org/project/hyodo/';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
		<title>HyoDo Evidence Graph — prototype</title>
		<link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml" />
		<link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico" sizes="32x32" />
		<link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/apple-touch-icon.png" />
		<meta name="theme-color" content="#0b0d10" />
		<meta
			name="description"
			content="A public, browser-only prototype of the HyoDo evidence graph. Defaults to fixed demo data; you can opt in to render a local hyodo.evidence-graph/v1 JSON file. Nothing is uploaded."
		/>
	</head>
	<body class="eg-page">
		<nav class="navbar">
			<a class="brand" href="/">HyoDo</a>
			<div class="nav-links">
				<a href="/docs/quickstart/">Docs</a>
				<a href="/docs/acl/">ACL</a>
				<a href="/docs/research/">Research</a>
				<a href={githubUrl}>GitHub</a>
				<a href={pypiUrl}>PyPI</a>
			</div>
		</nav>

		<main class="eg-wrap">
			<h1>HyoDo Evidence Graph <span class="eg-badge">Prototype</span></h1>

			<p class="eg-banner" id="eg-banner" data-source="fixture" role="note" aria-live="polite"><strong>Demo fixture.</strong> This is in-memory demo data, not a live run — nothing here is uploaded, stored, or fetched from a network. The <code>parent_event_id</code> and <code>evidence_refs</code> links shown below are optional <code>hyodo.agent-event/v1</code> fields shipped since 4.14.0; the installed <code>hyodo dashboard</code> renders them from your real ledger at <code>/graph</code>, while this public page defaults to fixed fixture data. You can opt in to render a local <code>hyodo.evidence-graph/v1</code> JSON file in this browser only. See <a href="/docs/evidence-graph/">the docs</a> for the exact boundary.</p>

			<div class="eg-load">
				<label class="eg-load-label" for="eg-file">Load local <code>hyodo.evidence-graph/v1</code> JSON</label>
				<input id="eg-file" type="file" accept="application/json" />
				<button type="button" id="eg-reset">Show demo fixture</button>
			</div>

			<p class="eg-key">Rows are participants, columns are step index, cells are events. Solid elbow = <code>parent_event_id</code> ("result of"). Dashed curve = <code>evidence_refs</code> ("decided from"). Red stub = broken link.</p>

			<section class="eg-consolebar" aria-label="evidence session console">
				<div class="eg-console-brand">
					<span class="eg-console-kicker">Evidence Console</span>
					<strong id="eg-console-session">SESSION / FIXTURE</strong>
				</div>
				<div class="eg-transport" aria-label="session status">
					<span class="eg-transport-mark" aria-hidden="true">■</span>
					<span id="eg-console-view">STATIC VIEW</span>
					<span class="eg-transport-divider" aria-hidden="true"></span>
					<span>STEP INDEX</span>
					<strong id="eg-console-steps">t0 — t7</strong>
				</div>
				<div class="eg-console-boundary" id="eg-console-boundary">DEMO DATA / NOT LIVE</div>
			</section>

			<div class="legend" aria-hidden="false">
				<span class="lg-item"
					><span class="lg-dot lg-dot-observed"
					></span><b>ALLOW</b></span
				>
				<span class="lg-item"
					><span class="lg-dot lg-dot-ask"></span><b
						>ASK</b
					></span
				>
				<span class="lg-item"
					><span class="lg-dot lg-dot-deny"></span><b
						>DENY</b
					></span
				>
				<span class="lg-item"
					><span class="lg-dot lg-dot-unobserved"></span><b
						>UNOBSERVED</b
					></span
				>
			</div>

			<p id="eg-instructions" class="sr-only">
				Tab to a cell to inspect its record. Press Escape to clear the panel
				without losing focus. Shift+Tab moves to the previous cell.
			</p>

			<div class="eg-main">
				<div class="graph-wrap" id="eg-root" aria-describedby="eg-instructions">
					<div class="grid" id="eg-grid"></div>
					<svg class="edges" id="eg-edges" aria-hidden="true"></svg>
				</div>
				<aside class="panel" id="eg-panel" aria-live="polite">
					<h2>5W1H</h2>
					<p class="placeholder">
						Hover or focus (Tab) a cell to inspect its record — who, when,
						what, where, how, why.
					</p>
				</aside>
			</div>

			<noscript>
				<p class="eg-key">The interactive grid needs JavaScript; the fixture and field meanings are documented at <a href="/docs/evidence-graph/">/docs/evidence-graph/</a>.</p>
			</noscript>

			<footer class="eg-footer">Data shape: <code>hyodo.agent-event/v1</code> events inside optional local <code>hyodo.evidence-graph/v1</code> JSON (event_id, run_id, ts, kind, actor, step_index, tool, policy, optional parent_event_id/evidence_refs). Default view is the demo fixture. Live ledger: <code>hyodo dashboard</code> at <code>/graph</code>. See <a href="/docs/evidence-graph/">the documentation</a> for details.</footer>
		</main>

		<script src="../scripts/evidence-graph-page.ts"></script>
	</body>
</html>
